Cell["\<\
The one-argument form accepts an exact_matrix, kernel_result, or \
common_kernel_result produced by the public cyclotomic functions. A restored \
matrix records \"rows\", \"columns\", and row-major flat \"entries\".\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"92aa01a5-760d-4e49-bd82-829e68a31574"],

Cell["\<\
For an RREF result, restore its \"reduced_matrix\" field. The complete \
rref_result Association is metadata and is not itself a restorable object.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ac21fd77-a1b9-45b5-970a-ddd4c7b1e413"],

Cell["\<\
The two-argument form requires the exact context to which element belongs. A \
context mismatch or malformed object returns Failure; no numerical \
approximation is used.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"009f1148-0f7e-4e8e-97e5-592f2f06b19a"]
}, Closed]],

